  clock: 3  # 0d6f
  nonce: 0d6f  # 0d6f
  message: "Closing as wont_do (audit 2026-04-26). Investigation: 'rst' IS in taxonomy.LANGUAGES (packages/hypergumbo-core/src/hypergumbo_core/taxonomy.py:451). The 3,079 'invalid language' hits on airflow were a verification-script bug — my /tmp/verify_bucket_a.py defined a hand-rolled KNOWN_LANGS set that omitted rst. The boundary nodes with language='rst' are structurally correct per the actual hypergumbo invariant. Of the 450 invalid-name nodes on airflow that ARE genuinely INV-nodij violations, only 20 are language=rst (sample names contain '/' — Sphinx cross-refs); the rest are typescript (360) and other producers. Those typescript invalid-name nodes are a different problem. Filing a follow-up if/when that becomes a priority. Net: this regression sub-item was misfiled; rst itself is fine."  # 0d6f
